793\"><strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"809\">Aansluiting:</strong> Speaker terminals<br data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"840\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart / Houtlook<br data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"860\"><strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"870\">Staat:</strong> Gebruikt, maar degelijk</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"953\">📦 <strong data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"916\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"919\">Bowers & Wilkins V201 Speakerset</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1014\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"977\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"980\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"contents\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
